target
Cargo.lock
artifacts

# cargo-fuzz's generated .gitignore excludes `corpus/` wholesale. The seed
# corpus for this target is DELIBERATELY committed: it is transliterated from
# the decision table in `shared-conformance/phonetic-vectors.json` and from the
# fold/substring boundary cases in `src/`. CI never runs the fuzzer, so an
# uncommitted corpus would mean every local run starts from nothing.
# Machine-found additions are not committed.
corpus/*
!corpus/vocab/
